","waarde":{"velden":[{"veld":"item-categorie","titel":"Category","waarde":"Upper-level course Bachelor"},{"veld":"item-voertaal","titel":"Instruction language","waarde":"Dutch, English"}]}},{"veld":"regio-rechts","titel":"","waarde":{"velden":[{"veld":"item-opmerking","titel":"Remark","waarde":"Caution: this information is subject to change"}]}}]},{"rubriek":"rubriek-inhoud","titel":"Aims and content","weergave":"UIT","velden":[{"veld":"item-inhoud-1","titel":"Aims","waarde":"<html>\n<head>\n\t<title></title>\n\t<style type=\"text/css\">body { font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial } table { font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial }\n\t</style>\n</head>\n<body><br />\n<br />\nKey objectives of the internship are to:<br />\n• Explore the job market / research practice;<br />\n• Gain experience in an organization, company, research project;<br />\n• Apply academic knowledge and skills in (research) practice;<br />\n• Reflect on one’s own performance in a professional environment;<br />\n• Prepare and orientate for the master and the future labor market.</body>\n</html>\n"},{"veld":"item-inhoud-2","titel":"Content","waarde":"<html>\n<head>\n\t<title></title>\n\t<style type=\"text/css\">body { font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial } table { font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial }\n\t</style>\n</head>\n<body>The main objective of the internship is to familiarize students with professional career activities.&nbsp;They will get acquainted with<br />\nparticular tasks and gain knowledge, but also and foremost learn how to function in a professional work environment and grow on a personal level. The internship is an opportunity to apply academic knowledge and skills in practice, and gain valuable work experience. Students are responsible for finding their internship organization.&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;</body>\n</html>\n"}]},{"rubriek":"rubriek-vrije-velden","titel":"Additional information","weergave":"UIT","velden":[{"veld":"item-vrij-veld-23","titel":"Contact person","gegevenstype":"TEKST",